   (kbm(9, 5, white={2: 'C', 3: 'D', 5: 'F', 6: 'G', 7: 'A'}, black={0: 'B♭', 3: 'E♭', 7: 'B♭'}), '<p><b>B flat major</b> starts on a black key. It has <b>two flats</b>: B♭ and E♭.</p><p>Its fingers are different: the thumb plays only the white keys <b>C</b> and <b>F</b>.</p>', 'Right hand: finger 4 on every B flat, 3 on E flat, thumb on C and F: 4 1 2 3, 1 2 3 4. Two octaves up and down, slowly.'),
   (f'<div style="display:flex;gap:30px;justify-content:center">' + ''.join(f'<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px">{sig}<b style="font-size:23px;color:{N}">{nm}</b><span style="font-size:17px;color:#6d6f9c">{sub}</span></div>' for sig, nm, sub in ((ksig2(sh=(8, 5)), 'D major', 'F♯ and C♯'), (ksig2(fl=(4, 7)), 'B♭ major', 'B♭ and E♭'))) + '</div>', '<p>The <b>sharps</b> always arrive in the same order: <b>F</b> first, then <b>C</b>. The <b>flats</b> too: <b>B</b> first, then <b>E</b>.</p><p>Two sharps: D major. Two flats: B flat major.</p>', 'Look at the start of a piece. Count the sharps or flats and name the major key.'),
